      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "bb020a438047604c0953a2cccb87dd62fe532b2cad6abcb3ded0a48866debb78:000000_-7195522746674837350:g0:r7",
      "row_index_0based": 7,
      "serialized_row_index": 7,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "海岸を巡回していると、\n無数の魚が激しく逃げ惑う、『ナブラ』を発見した。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
